  "what_this_measures": "PARAMS-FILE MEMBERSHIP ONLY: is the key present and true in the params file this arm resolves to (fleet_executor._base_params_for: bold*/risky* -> aggressive/params.json, everything else -> params.json), after its accounts.json params_patch.",
